<title>INDIA: India's Raymond 96/97 net falls.</title>
<headline>India's Raymond 96/97 net falls.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March 31, 1997</p>
<p>	     (in million rupees unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		88.84     vs    957.61</p>
<p>    Turnover	     9,777.72     vs  8,922.13</p>
<p>    Div (in rupees)	  1.0	vs	5.0</p>
<p>    Other income	   156.55     vs    170.81</p>
<p>    Gross profit	   764.02     vs  1,601.08</p>
<p>    Depreciation	   657.79     vs    523.47</p>
<p>    Tax			 17.38     vs    120.00</p>
<p>Note: Diversified firm Raymond Ltd did not give any explanation for the steep fall in its net profit.</p>
</text>
